<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica's JSE admits Vector Equities as new member.</title>
<headline>SAfrica's JSE admits Vector Equities as new member.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Thursday it had admitted Vector Equities (Pty) Ltd as a corporate entity (limited liability) member of the bourse with immediate effect.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
